      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STORMS WILL ROLL (6) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 1.75 lengths from the winner BRAILEY BANNER (17.54) at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Top chance in this line up. PONY TAIL (7) was well fancied last time on the back of some sparkling form, which included a five-start winning streak, but could only manage second (17.63) at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expected to be in this for a long way. BRAILEY BANNER (4) is a well performed dog who recorded his 8th career win last time out at this track (17.42). Solid record here at this trip including three wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Should be in this for a long way. LEVI DESIGN (2) boasts a solid strike-rate from this box.",
